WrapperToken::rollover
├── when caller is not rollOverBot
│   └── it should revert with NotRollOverBot
└── given caller is rollOverBot
    ├── given contract is not paused
    │   └── it should revert with IsNotPaused
    └── given contract is paused
        ├── when newUnderlyingToken is zero address
        │   └── it should revert with InvalidInput
        ├── when newUnderlyingToken equals current underlyingToken
        │   └── it should revert with InvalidInput
        ├── when newUnderlyingToken decimals differ from DECIMALS
        │   └── it should revert with InvalidInput
        ├── when swapTarget is zero address
        │   └── it should revert with InvalidInput
        ├── when swapTarget is not whitelisted
        │   └── it should revert with InvalidInput
        ├── when whitelisted approveTarget is zero address
        │   └── it should revert with InvalidInput
        ├── when minAmountOut is zero
        │   └── it should revert with InvalidInput
        ├── when amountIn is zero
        │   └── it should revert with InvalidInput
        ├── when contract underlying balance is zero
        │   └── it should revert
        ├── when swap call fails
        │   └── it should revert with SwapFailed
        ├── when swap leaves sell token balance
        │   └── it should revert with SellTokenBalanceLeftover
        ├── when buy token received is less than minAmountOut
        │   └── it should revert with MinAmountOutNotMet
        ├── when updated exchangeRate would be zero
        │   └── it should revert with ExchangeRateZero
        ├── given underlying token was donated after pause
        │   ├── when amountIn matches swapData amount but is less than wrapper underlying balance
        │   │   ├── it should approve whitelisted approveTarget for amountIn
        │   │   ├── it should execute swap via swapTarget
        │   │   ├── it should reset approval to zero
        │   │   ├── it should update exchangeRate based on amountIn
        │   │   ├── it should update underlyingToken to newUnderlyingToken
        │   │   ├── it should emit UnderlyingTokenSet
        │   │   ├── it should emit ExchangeRateUpdated
        │   │   ├── it should emit Rollover
        │   │   └── it should leave donated amount as remnant sell-token balance
        │   └── when amountIn includes donated amount but swapData matches pre-donation amount
        │       └── it should revert with SellTokenBalanceLeftover
        └── when all inputs are valid and swap succeeds
            ├── it should approve whitelisted approveTarget for amountIn
            ├── it should execute swap via swapTarget
            ├── it should reset approval to zero
            ├── it should update exchangeRate
            ├── it should update underlyingToken to newUnderlyingToken
            ├── it should leave zero underlying token balance on contract
            ├── it should leave zero underlying token allowance on approveTarget
            ├── it should emit UnderlyingTokenSet
            ├── it should emit ExchangeRateUpdated
            └── it should emit Rollover
